WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.13 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Monitoring and reviewing risk

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Early risks change fast: review them often and watch for warning signs from launch.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Review high risks monthly and others quarterly.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Set a warning sign, such as cash below your threshold.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Ask what the register missed when a risk happens.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You set your risk review routine and early warning indicators.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
